    "updated_at": "2016-09-28T11:55:36Z",
    "body": "Edge seems to have no-op behavior. The document.domain getter in Edge also appears to throw if you do successfully set document.domain. Safari, Firefox, and Chrome all agree though, so we should go with that I think.\n",
